    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n17999" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αὐτο-φόνος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>murdering one's kin,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αὐτοφόνα κακά</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Th.</u>
					850
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.), <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ag.</u>
				1091
			</span></i> (lyr.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παλάμη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					7.149
				</span></i>
			 (<i><span class="en">
				Leont.
			</span></i>). Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-νως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Supp.</u>
					65
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>suicidal,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Opp.
				<u>C.</u>
				2.480
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>slaying with one's own hand,</i> ib.<i><span class="en">
				4.290
			</span></i>.</div>
